# Model weights fetched by backend/scripts/fetch_models.sh (257 MB, digest-pinned).
# Never commit these: the digest lives in the module's ModuleSpec, which is what
# makes a committed weight file pointless and a large one a liability.
backend/.models/
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

